#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "180_Hana"
msgid "Oh, Chief! Out wandering around as usual, I see."
msgstr "¡Jefe! ¿Vagando por ahí como siempre?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "192_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, I don't know about \"wandering around.\" I'm a busy guy,\\r\nyou know?"
msgstr "Bueno, no le diría \"vagar\". Soy un tipo ocupado,\\r\n¿Sabes?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "204_Hana"
msgid "Oh, spare me! You were off playing pachinko or something,\\r\nweren't you!?"
msgstr "¡Oh, vamos! Estabas fuera jugando al pachinko o algo,\\r\n¡¿Verdad?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "216_Hana"
msgid "Do you have any idea how many jobs I took care of while you\\r\nwere out goofing around?"
msgstr "¿Tienes idea de cuánto trabajé mientras holgazaneabas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "228_Hana"
msgid "Meanwhile, the world keeps turning. Apparently, some\\r\ncounterfeit bills have been making their way around town.\\r\nI saw it on a news site."
msgstr "Mientras el mundo gira. Recientemente, esparcieron.\\r\nbilletes falsos por la ciudad. Lo vi en un sitio web."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "252_Akiyama"
msgid "Aha! So you've been surfing the net all day, have you?"
msgstr "¡Aja! Así que has estado en internet todo el día, ¿No?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "264_Hana"
msgid "I've been gathering info for work!"
msgstr "¡Recopilaba información para el trabajo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "276_Akiyama"
msgid "Whatever you say... Counterfeit bills, huh? That's bad for\\r\nbusiness..."
msgstr "Como digas... Billetes falsos, ¿Eh? Eso es malo para\\r\nel negocio..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "288_Hana"
msgid "Tell me about it! I hope they catch the crook soon."
msgstr "¡Ni me lo digas! Espero que atrapen al culpable."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "300_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm sure Tokyo's finest are on the case."
msgstr "Seguramente los mejores oficiales de Tokio\\r\ninvestigan el caso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "312_Akiyama"
msgid "*yawn*"
msgstr "*bosteza*"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "324_Hana"
msgid "Why do I even bother...?"
msgstr "¿Para qué me molesto...?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "372_Man"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr "Oi."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "384_Hana"
msgid "Oh, hello. Chief! We've got a customer."
msgstr "Oh, hola. ¡Jefe! Tenemos un cliente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "396_Akiyama"
msgid "Oh yeah? Who is it?"
msgstr "¿Ah, sí? ¿Quién es?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "408_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah, Hayashida-san. Is it payback day already?"
msgstr "Ah, Hayashida-san. ¿Ya es día de paga?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "420_Hana"
msgid "Ugh, I wish you'd keep track of these things..."
msgstr "Uh, me gustaría que seas mas atento con esas cosas..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "432_Hayashida"
msgid "Here's this month's payment."
msgstr "Aquí tiene la paga del mes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "444_Akiyama"
msgid "Thank you. Just give me a moment to make sure we're all\\r\nsquared away..."
msgstr "Gracias. Dame un momento para comprobar que todo esté\\r\nen orden..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "504_Hana"
msgid "You're always so prompt with your payments, Hayashida-san.\\r\nWe really appreciate it."
msgstr "Siempre es tan puntual con sus pagos, Hayashida-san.\\r \nSe lo agradecemos mucho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "516_Hayashida"
msgid "Times are tough, so it certainly hasn't been easy...\\r\nBut I've managed to hang in there."
msgstr "No son tiempos fáciles...\\r\nPero me las he arreglado para llegar a tiempo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "528_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, in this line of business, you're a rare bird, as far\\r\nas customers go."
msgstr "Bueno, en este tipo de negocios eres un cliente raro de\\r\nencontrar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "540_Akiyama"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "... ¿Eh?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "552_Akiyama"
msgid "Hayashida-san, did you, by any chance, withdraw this money\\r\nfrom an ATM?"
msgstr "Hayashida-san, por casualidad, ¿Retiraste este dinero\\r\nde un cajero automático?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "564_Hayashida"
msgid "No, I took it from the safe at work..."
msgstr "No, lo tome de la caja fuerte de mi tienda..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "576_Hana"
msgid "You run a restaurant, don't you? A French restaurant! Ooh,\\r\nI've got to try it out sometime."
msgstr "Tienes un restaurante, ¿Cierto? ¡Un restaurante francés!,\\r\nOoh, tengo que probarlo alguna vez."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "588_Akiyama"
msgid "There are some, uh... counterfeit bills in here."
msgstr "Hay algunos, em... Billetes falsos aquí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "600_Hayashida"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "612_Akiyama"
msgid "They're actually pretty well done. Definitely good enough to\\r\nfool the eye... Probably couldn't fool an ATM, though."
msgstr "Está bastante bien hecho. Definitivamente podría engañar\\r\nal ojo... Aunque, no creo que burle a un cajero automático."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "624_Hana"
msgid "Counterfeit bills? Like the ones I just read about online?"
msgstr "¿Billetes falsos? ¡¿Como lo que acabo de leer en línea?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "636_Akiyama"
msgid "Could be... And I'm thinking we just found the man\\r\nresponsible."
msgstr "Tal vez... Y creo haber encontrado al culpable."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "648_Hayashida"
msgid "What are you saying!?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué estás diciendo?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "660_Akiyama"
msgid "Sorry. Bad joke. I doubt you'd knowingly use fake bills. I'm\\r\nsure you're beyond reproach."
msgstr "Lo siento, lo siento. Solo bromeo. Seguramente no sabías\\r\nque eran falsos. No te preocupes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "672_Hayashida"
msgid "Of course I am! I've been working my fingers to the bone to\\r\npay back this money! Why would I try to swindle my way out\\r\nnow!?"
msgstr "¡Obviamente! ¡He trabajado día y noche para pagar mi deuda!\\r\n¡¿Por que intentaría algo así?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "684_Akiyama"
msgid "Exactly. Do you remember when you got this money?"
msgstr "Exacto. Hayashida-san, ¿Recuerda donde consiguió el dinero?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "696_Hayashida"
msgid "Let's see... Sorry, I'm a little frazzled...  Last week, I\\r\ndeposited everything at the bank, so this must've happened\\r\nsometime after that."
msgstr "Veamos... Lo siento, estoy exhausto... En la semana pasada\\r\ndeposité todo en el banco, debió suceder luego de eso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "708_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, that helps narrow it down. Any suspicious customers\\r\ncome by this past week?"
msgstr "Bueno, eso ayuda. ¿Has tenido algún cliente sospechoso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "720_Hayashida"
msgid "Suspicious customers?"
msgstr "¿Cliente sospechoso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "732_Akiyama"
msgid "Say, someone who ordered a thousand yen dish and paid with a ten thousand yen bill?"
msgstr "Digamos, ¿Alguien ordenó un plato de mil yenes y pagó con un billete de diez mil?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "744_Hayashida"
msgid "Sure, that happens pretty often..."
msgstr "Claro, eso pasa mucho..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "756_Akiyama"
msgid "Anybody ask you to break big bills as they paid?"
msgstr "¿Alguien pidió cambiar dinero al pagar?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "768_Hayashida"
msgid "Yes! There was somebody like that a couple days ago.\\r\nI couldn't exactly say no..."
msgstr "¡Sí! Hubo alguien así hace unos días.\\r\nNo pude decir que no y tuve que aceptar..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "780_Akiyama"
msgid "That might be our man. Do you remember what he looked like?"
msgstr "Ese podría ser nuestro hombre. ¿Recuerdas cómo era?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "792_Hayashida"
msgid "He struck me as kind of a yakuza type, and he was pretty\\r\nintimidating, so it was kinda hard for me to turn him\\r\ndown..."
msgstr "Parecía una especie de yakuza, y era bastante intimidante,\\r\nasí que fue difícil para mí rechazarle..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "804_Hana"
msgid "That's got to be him! Super shady!"
msgstr "¡Sospechoso! ¡Debe ser ese tipo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "816_Akiyama"
msgid "Very interesting. Now let me ask you this. Are you much of\\r\nan artist, Hayashida-san?"
msgstr "Interesante. Ahora, déjame preguntarte algo.\\r\n¿Eres bueno dibujando, Hayashida-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "828_Hayashida"
msgid "Me? I don't draw very well, no..."
msgstr "¿Yo? No, no lo creo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "840_Akiyama"
msgid "Ah, I see. Well, I'm no Picasso myself. So that just\\r\nleaves..."
msgstr "Ah, ya veo. Bueno, yo tampoco soy Picasso. Entonces,\\r\nconfiamos en..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "852_Hana"
msgid "Who, me?"
msgstr "... ¿Yo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "864_Akiyama"
msgid "Yep. It's your time to shine, Hana-chan. Show us what you\\r\ncan do."
msgstr "Sep. Es tu momento de brillar, Hana-chan. Muéstranos lo\\r\nque puedes hacer."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "876_Hana"
msgid "Well, uh, all right..."
msgstr "Bueno, am, está bien..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "888_Akiyama"
msgid "Hayashida-san, would you please describe this customer?\\r\nWhatever you can remember."
msgstr "Hayashida-san, ¿Podrías describir al cliente?\\r\nCon lo que recuerdes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "900_Hayashida"
msgid "Let's see. He was about forty years old and..."
msgstr "Veamos. Aparentaba tener unos cuarenta años..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "912_Hana"
msgid "Uh-huh...  Forty years old..."
msgstr "Ajam... Cuarenta años..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "972_Hayashida"
msgid "That's about all I can remember..."
msgstr "Es todo lo puedo recordar..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "984_Hana"
msgid "I see... So, something like this?"
msgstr "Ya veo... Así que, ¿Se veía algo así?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "996_Akiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1008_Hayashida"
msgid "...Ahem."
msgstr "... Pfff."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1020_Hana"
msgid "Hm? What's wrong?"
msgstr "¿Hm? ¿Que pasa?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1032_Akiyama"
msgid "So we're looking for some kind of ogre...?"
msgstr "Entonces, ¿El culpable es... Un ogro...?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1044_Hayashida"
msgid "Oh, I don't know... It does kind of look like him."
msgstr "Oh, no lo sé... Pero tiene un parecido a él."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1056_Akiyama"
msgid "Really!? You sure you're not just being polite?"
msgstr "¡¿En serio?! No hace falta que seas educado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1068_Hana"
msgid "Oh, come on! You told me to draw, so I did!"
msgstr "¡Oh, vamos! ¡Dijiste que dibuje y eso hice!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1080_Akiyama"
msgid "Hahaha! Forgive me, I had no idea you were so bad at it.\\r\nAhem... Now then, Hayashida-san, do you really see a\\r\nresemblance?"
msgstr "¡Ja, ja, ja! Perdón, perdón, no pensé que eras tan mala\\r\ndibujando. Ejem... Bien, Hayashida-san,\\r\n¿Realmente ves un parecido?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1092_Hayashida"
msgid "Yes... As a matter of fact, I do."
msgstr "Si... Lo digo en serio."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1104_Akiyama"
msgid "I see... And here I thought I was a man of the world..."
msgstr "Ya veo... Nunca se sabe que encontraremos en el mundo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1116_Hana"
msgid "Chief..."
msgstr "Jefe..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1128_Akiyama"
msgid "Never mind. Hana-chan, can you make me some copies of this?\\r\nAbout fifty or so should do."
msgstr "Da igual. Hana-chan, haz copias de esto.\\r\nUnas cincuenta bastarán."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1140_Hana"
msgid "Like I'm not embarrassed enough? Look, I'll make the copies,\\r\nbut don't tell me you're going to try and find this guy\\r\nyourself?"
msgstr "¿Eh? Como si no estuviera lo suficientemente avergonzada.\\r\nDe acuerdo, las haré. Presidente, ¿Está usted intentando\\r\nencontrarlo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1152_Akiyama"
msgid "Thinkin' about it..."
msgstr "Ando dándole vueltas..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1164_Hayashida"
msgid "Oh, you don't have to go that far! I'll replace the fakes\\r\nright away. Besides, wouldn't this be better left in the\\r\nhands of the police?"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¡No tienes que ir tan lejos!. Voy a\\r \nreemplazar las falsificaciones de inmediato. Aparte,\\r \n¿No seria mejor dejarlo en manos de la policía?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1176_Akiyama"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll take care of it. I'll be in touch if I\\r\nfind out anything."
msgstr "Tranquilo. Yo me encargo. Te aviso si encuentro algo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1188_Hayashida"
msgid "If you say so... I suppose I'll be on my way, then."
msgstr "Como digas... Si me disculpan, debo irme."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1248_Hana"
msgid "I've got your copies ready. Are you really gonna go look\\r\nfor this guy?"
msgstr "Tengo las copias listas. Pero jefe, ¿De verdad va a buscar\\r\nal culpable?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1260_Akiyama"
msgid "That's the plan."
msgstr "Así es."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1272_Hana"
msgid "What do you want to do that for? Weren't you just talking\\r\nabout how \"Tokyo's finest\" were on the case?"
msgstr "¿Por que te preocupas ahora? ¿No decías que\\r\n\"los mejores oficiales de Tokio\" seguían el caso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1284_Akiyama"
msgid "I did intend to let them handle it, yes. But it's a\\r\ndifferent story when one of my customers is involved."
msgstr "Esa era mi intención. Sin embargo, es diferente ahora.\\r\nUno de mis clientes está envuelto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1296_Akiyama"
msgid "My customers' money holds a deep significance to them. For\\r\nHayashida-san, it's the tangible fruit of all the hard work\\r\nhe puts into making delicious food."
msgstr "El dinero de mis clientes tiene un significado para ellos.\\r\nPara Hayashida-san, es fruto de su esfuerzo por hacer\\r\nla comida mas deliciosa."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1308_Akiyama"
msgid "Way I see it, fake money is like spitting in the face of\\r\neveryone who puts in a hard day's work, and well...\\r\nFrankly, it pisses me off."
msgstr "Para mi, el dinero falso es como escupir en quienes\\r\nse esfuerzan todos los días trabajando duro.\\r\nEso, francamente, me jode mucho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1320_Hana"
msgid "Chief..."
msgstr "Jefe..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1332_Akiyama"
msgid "I'm not entirely sure this is the culprit, but it's all I\\r\nhave to go on right now. I'll ask around. Take care of the\\r\nthe office while I'm gone, all right?"
msgstr "Dudo que el culpable sea realmente así, pero es lo que\\r\ntengo. Iré a preguntar por allí. Cuida la oficina mientras\\r \nyo me encargo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1344_Hana"
msgid "Aw, Chief, can't you at least try to get through some of\\r\nthis paperwork first...?"
msgstr "Ah, Jefe, ¿No puedes hacer algo de papeleo antes...?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1404_Akiyama"
msgid "(Hana-chan really slaved over this sketch... Guess I should start handing 'em out.)"
msgstr "(Hana-chan realmente se esforzó con el boceto...\nCreo que empezaré repartiéndolos)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1416_Akiyama"
msgid "(I'll stop by my friends' places first. Maybe somebody who usually deals in big bills, like the owner of Sushi Gin.)"
msgstr "(Iré a las tiendas de mis amigos. Empezando por el dueño de Sushi Gin, que parece manejar muchos billetes de 10.000)."

